---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---
<Base title="About — Syasya&Realis" page="about">
<main id="about-us">
  <section class="ab-hero">
    <div class="eyebrow mono"><span>(About) <span data-name>Syasya&Realis</span></span><span>The studio</span></div>
    <h1 class="rv">Between what is seen and what is <span class="serif">felt.</span></h1>
    <p class="lead rv">Founded by Syasya Ahmad, <span data-name>Syasya&Realis</span> is an independent multidisciplinary creative studio exploring the intersection of <em class="hl">photography, film, montage, and graphic design.</em></p>
    <figure class="ab-mark rv" aria-label="Syasya&Realis monogram"><i class="srm light" aria-hidden="true"></i><figcaption class="lockup">Syasya&Realis<span>Creative Studio</span></figcaption></figure>
  </section>

  <section style="padding-top:0">
    <div class="eyebrow mono"><span>(01) The founder</span><span>Syasya Ahmad</span></div>
    <div class="profile">
      <div class="rv">
        <p>Our work spans fashion campaigns, short films, education promos and brand content — including projects for J Luxe and Unisel.</p>
        <p>Guided by an instinct for composition, atmosphere, and narrative, Syasya transforms everyday realities into <em class="hl">considered visual expressions</em> that balance authenticity with artistic intention.</p>
      </div>
      <dl class="facts-list rv" id="ab-facts"></dl>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section style="padding-top:0" id="ab-name">
    <div class="eyebrow mono"><span>(02) The name</span><span>A personal visual signature</span></div>
    <div class="ci-names">
      <article class="rv"><h2>Syasya</h2><p class="mono">A name. A perspective. A creative signature.</p><p>The founder’s name, Syasya Ahmad — her individual artistic voice and approach to image-making.</p></article>
      <article class="rv"><h2><span class="serif">&amp;</span> Realis</h2><p class="mono">Observation · storytelling · interpretation</p><p>The studio’s artistic identity: visual expression, observation and authentic storytelling.</p></article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section style="padding-top:0" id="ab-mark">
    <div class="eyebrow mono"><span>(03) The mark</span><span><a href="/guidelines">Brand guidelines →</a></span></div>
    <h2 class="h2 rv" style="margin-bottom:clamp(36px,7vh,72px)">Two initials, <span class="serif">one signature.</span></h2>
    <div class="anat">
      <figure class="anat-mark rv" id="anatMark"><i class="srm light" aria-hidden="true"></i>
        <b class="hs" data-k="s" style="left:24%;top:30%">S</b><b class="hs" data-k="r" style="left:78%;top:52%">R</b>
        <b class="hs" data-k="amp" style="left:51%;top:24%">&amp;</b><b class="hs" data-k="dia" style="left:56%;top:55%">◆</b></figure>
      <div>
        <ol class="anat-list">
          <li class="rv" data-k="s" tabindex="0"><span class="big">S</span><div><h3>Syasya</h3><p>The founder’s name, personal identity and creative voice.</p></div></li>
          <li class="rv" data-k="r" tabindex="0"><span class="big">R</span><div><h3>Realis</h3><p>Visual expression, observation and authentic storytelling.</p></div></li>
          <li class="rv" data-k="amp" tabindex="0"><span class="big">&amp;</span><div><h3>Connection</h3><p>A bond between perspectives, collaboration and creative flow.</p></div></li>
          <li class="rv" data-k="dia" tabindex="0"><span class="big dia"><i></i></span><div><h3>Red diamond</h3><p>Creativity, passion, precision and individuality.</p></div></li>
        </ol>
        <p class="rv anat-note">Drawn from Bodoni and calligraphy — fluid curves with contrasting thick and thin strokes — in a minimal palette of black, white and red.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section style="padding-top:0">
    <div class="eyebrow mono"><span>(04) Why us</span><span>What you get</span></div>
    <h2 class="h2 rv" style="margin-bottom:clamp(36px,7vh,72px)">Why brands work with us.</h2>
    <div class="usps">
      <article class="usp rv"><span class="n">01</span><h3>One team, end to end</h3><p>Video, photo and design under one roof. One contact, one consistent look across everything you publish.</p></article>
      <article class="usp rv"><span class="n">02</span><h3>A structured brief</h3><p>Every project starts with the same brief: goal, audience, formats, references, timeline and budget. No guesswork later.</p></article>
      <article class="usp rv"><span class="n">03</span><h3>Every format from one production</h3><p>Masters plus 16:9, 9:16, 1:1 and 4:5 cut-downs, ready for your website, social channels and ads.</p></article>
      <article class="usp rv"><span class="n">04</span><h3>Story before polish</h3><p>We plan around what your audience should feel and do — then finish with colour, sound and motion.</p></article>
      <article class="usp rv"><span class="n">05</span><h3>A clear quote first</h3><p>Scope, deliverables and revision rounds are agreed in writing before any work starts.</p></article>
      <article class="usp rv"><span class="n">06</span><h3>Easy to reach</h3><p>Brief us on WhatsApp or by email in two minutes. You get a reply and a time for the brief — not a long form.</p></article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section style="padding-top:0" id="ab-testi">
    <div class="eyebrow mono"><span>(05) Testimonials</span><span>Clients</span></div>
    <h2 class="h2 rv" style="margin-bottom:clamp(36px,7vh,72px)">In our clients' <span class="serif">words.</span></h2>
    <div class="quotes" id="quotes"></div>
  </section>

  <section style="padding-top:0">
    <div class="ab-cta">
      <p class="rv">Ready when <span class="serif">you</span> are.</p>
      <a class="btn fill" href="/#contact">Start a project
        <svg viewBox="0 0 14 14" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><path d="M3 11 11 3M5 3h6v6"/></svg></a>
    </div>
  </section>
</main>
</Base>
